			<h1 class="headline">Startup Accelerator</h1>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
<div id="content_area">
	<div class="wrap content-columns">
		<div id="post-30" class="post_box top">
			<div class="headline_area">
			</div>
			<div class="post_content">
<p>XLerateHealth offers an <a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20140724033415/http://www.xleratehealth.com/accelerator/curriculum/">intensive 12-week training course</a> that connects your startup to world-class <a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20140724033415/http://www.xleratehealth.com/mentors/">Mentors</a> and leading health and wellness companies in the United States. Participants will have continued exposure to potential customers,  partners, and thought-leaders. Our Mentors are the backbone of our program and offer a network that can dramatically impact the trajectory of your business. The program is a combination of classroom time, one-on-one sessions with Mentors, and focused customer discovery.</p>
<h3><a name="dates"></a><span style="color: #ff9900;">Important Program Dates</span></h3>
<p><div class="threecol-one"><a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20140724033415/http://www.xleratehealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/02/Pencil-70px.png"><img class="size-full wp-image-974 alignleft" alt="Pencil Icon" src="http://web.archive.org/web/20140724033415im_/http://www.xleratehealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/02/Pencil-70px.png" width="70" height="70"/></a></p>
<h3>Applications Due</h3>
<h4>05/31/14 </div></h4>
<p><div class="threecol-one"><a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20140724033415/http://www.xleratehealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/02/Tasks-70px.png"><img class="size-full wp-image-975 alignleft" alt="Checklist Icon" src="http://web.archive.org/web/20140724033415im_/http://www.xleratehealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/02/Tasks-70px.png" width="70" height="70"/></a></p>
<h3>Program Starts</h3>
<h4>08/04/14 </div></h4>
<p><div class="threecol-one last"><a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20140724033415/http://www.xleratehealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/02/Goal-70px.png"><img class="size-full wp-image-976 alignleft" alt="Goal Icon" src="http://web.archive.org/web/20140724033415im_/http://www.xleratehealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/02/Goal-70px.png" width="70" height="70"/></a></p>
<h3>Demo Day</h3>
<h4>10/30/14 </div><div class="clear"></div></h4>
<h3><span style="color: #ff9900;">Why Your Startup Should Apply to XLerateHealth</span></h3>
<p>XLerateHealth&#8217;s Mentor base, our access to customers and pilot sites, and our extensive experience in building successful startups makes our program a leader among healthcare accelerators. You should apply to XLerateHealth because our focus is on getting you face to face with customers as quickly as possible. You will leave this program with much more than a pitch deck &#8211; you’ll leave XLerateHealth with a viable business.</p>
<h3><span style="color: #ff9900;">What We&#8217;re Looking For</span></h3>
<p>We are looking for dynamic teams of entrepreneurs who are passionate about what they do and are interested in creating disruptive solutions to tough problems in the healthcare ecosystem. We prefer teams that include founders with technical ability, a knowledge of the healthcare industry, and who are intent on succeeding as scaleable commercial enterprises. We expect all key team members to participate in Louisville for the duration of the program.</p>
<h3><span style="color: #ff9900;">Application Process and Requirements</span></h3>
<p>We are accepting <a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20140724033415/http://www.f6s.com/xleratehealthfall2014#/apply" onclick="javascript:_gaq.push(['_trackEvent','outbound-article','http://web.archive.org/web/20140724033415/http://www.f6s.com']);">online</a> applications until <strong>May 31, 2014.</strong> After an initial review of all applications, we will contact select companies to participate in a web conference. Our review period will continue throughout May, and we will begin notifying selected companies in June.</p>
<h3><span style="color: #ff9900;">What Selected Teams Get </span></h3>
<ul>
<li dir="ltr">A $20,000 stipend</li>
<li dir="ltr">Support from XLerateHealth&#8217;s <a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20140724033415/http://www.xleratehealth.com/mentors/">Mentor</a> network, as well as introductions and meetings with pilot customers, potential funders and potential acquirers.</li>
<li dir="ltr">Free office space in the heart of Louisville’s downtown within walking distance to the NuLu district’s bars, coffee shops, restaurants and meeting/co-working spaces.</li>
</ul>
<h3><span style="color: #ff9900;">What XLerateHealth Gets</span></h3>
<p>In exchange for the funding, support, and mentorship, XLerateHealth receives a 6% equity stake in your company. If you do not require the $20,000 stipend, XLerate Health will receive a 2% equity stake. Like the founders, XLerateHealth receives common stock.</p>
<h3><span style="color: #ff9900;">Your Intellectual Property is Safe</span></h3>
<p>Your application will only be viewed by the XLerateHealth selection team and will remain confidential.</p>
<a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20140724033415/http://www.f6s.com/xleratehealthfall2014#/apply/" onclick="javascript:_gaq.push(['_trackEvent','outbound-article','http://web.archive.org/web/20140724033415/http://www.f6s.com']);" class="th-button orange xl" no><span>Apply Now</span></a>
